# Beszel agent environment (docs/beszel.md).
# Copy this file to beszel.env on the host and fill in KEY. beszel.env is
# gitignored — never commit it.

# REQUIRED. The hub's public SSH key (ed25519); the hub generates the keypair
# on its first start (root-owned beszel/data/id_ed25519, private key only) and
# the agent accepts only connections signed by it. Get the public half with
#   make beszel-key      # sudo ssh-keygen -y on that file
# (or from the hub UI: Add System → the "Public key" field). One line, e.g.
#   KEY=ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
KEY=
